// Project-scoped oh-my-opencode-slim config (committed on purpose).
// Discovery: <repo>/.opencode/oh-my-opencode-slim.json[c], merged user -> ancestors -> cwd.
// Deep-merged keys: presets, agents, council, backgroundJobs, fallback, webfetch, multiplexer,
// interview, acpAgents, companion. Everything else (and every array) is REPLACED by this file.
// Root-level `preset` pins the project default; delete it to let each dev keep their own.
// No secrets here: only model IDs/variants/skills/mcps. Use "{env:VAR}" if a value needs an env.
// Changes in .opencode/ alter tools/models/permissions -> treat PRs touching it as security-relevant.
// Escape hatch to ignore this layer entirely: OPENCODE_DISABLE_PROJECT_CONFIG=true
{
  "$schema": "https://unpkg.com/oh-my-opencode-slim@latest/oh-my-opencode-slim.schema.json",
